Drop device profiles here.

Everything else in this directory is ignored, so a 35 MB trace exported from
Chrome DevTools can sit next to the source without any chance of being
committed. It lives inside the repository because a dev container cannot read
anything outside it.

    node perf/profile.mjs perf/.prof perf/traces --map dist/assets

Both directory arguments resolve to the newest file in them, so nothing has to
be renamed or typed out. See ../README.md.
